      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a moderate probability of the CLARITY Act passing the procedural vote, given the bipartisan desire for regulatory clarity, but a high probability of continued debate and potential amendments. The market\'s immediate reaction will depend on the clarity and favorability of the initial legislative steps. The long-term outlook remains cautiously optimistic for regulatory clarity eventually, driving gradual institutional adoption.",
