      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A probability-weighted outlook suggests a moderately bullish trajectory for Bitcoin, driven by strong macro factors (60% probability), but tempered by persistent security concerns and potential regulatory headwinds (40% probability). The Liquid Network hack will likely be a short-term negative catalyst for the sidechain itself, with a limited, though noticeable, impact on Bitcoin\'s broader market sentiment.",
