    outlook: "If Treasury debt buybacks continue and sanctions remain in place, Bitcoin is poised to test the $70,000 level. However, any major security incident or regulatory action could reverse the rally within weeks. The green‑energy PAC is likely to keep the political spotlight on crypto‑funded climate initiatives, potentially catalyzing new tokenized ESG offerings.",
    conclusion: "Bitcoin’s rally reflects macro‑financial stress, yet the SafePal breach and a politically active crypto PAC inject fresh uncertainty. Investors should balance the upside from dollar‑system risk with the downside from security and policy headwinds, employing diversified exposure and vigilant risk management.",
