    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual image illustrating the challenge of data analysis in finance: A magnifying glass hovers over a chaotic arrangement of unrelated documents, such as a police badge, a smartphone, and a personal lease agreement, instead of financial charts, company reports, or stock tickers. The background features a blurred, professional financial district skyline of India, with digital overlays indicating \'NO DATA\' or \'MISMATCHED INFORMATION\'. The visual should convey a serious, professional, and slightly abstract tone, emphasizing the critical lack of relevant financial data for an IPO analysis. This is an industry-specific visual focusing on the conceptual hurdle.",
