      neutralCase: "The market will likely see continued innovation in AI and robotics, balanced by ongoing competition and regulatory challenges. While Unitree\'s IPO is a strong signal, global tech markets will remain volatile. Crypto\'s political influence will grow, but its impact on policy will be incremental rather than revolutionary, leading to a complex but manageable environment for tech-focused investors.",
