    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing a financial market divergence. On one side, a vibrant, upward-trending graph made of glowing digital lines and abstract blockchain elements, symbolizing crypto growth. On the other side, a more subdued, slightly downward-sloping graph with traditional stock market tickers and a \'caution\' sign, representing tech market headwinds. A clear, distinct boundary or a subtle blend in the middle. The overall color palette should be professional, with bright accents for crypto and muted tones for traditional tech. Focus on the idea of two distinct market forces at play, with subtle hints of institutional hands guiding the crypto side.",
