    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the multifaceted nature of the cryptocurrency market. On one side, abstract digital graphs and upward arrows symbolizing institutional growth and investment, with a subtle Bitcoin logo integrated. On the other side, intertwined chains and legal gavels signifying regulatory challenges and lawsuits, alongside a small, stylized padlock with a broken link to denote security risks and scams. The overall scene should convey complexity and dynamic forces at play, with a balanced color palette suggesting both opportunity and caution. Use deep blues, greens, and subtle reds/oranges for contrast. Avoid direct company logos or specific app depictions. High-quality, professional, and sophisticated digital art style.",
