      bullCase: "The bull case for crypto hinges on the eventual establishment of clear, favorable regulatory frameworks that reduce uncertainty and encourage institutional adoption. Coupled with continued technological innovation, potentially driven by advancements in AI and broader tech investments, this could lead to significant capital inflows and market maturation. Resolution of state-level legal challenges like the Illinois lawsuit could set positive precedents, fostering a more stable and predictable environment for growth.",
