    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic industry-specific visual representing the global cryptocurrency market. Focus on interconnected elements: a digital graph showing an upward trend for Bitcoin, subtly influenced by a stylized US Treasury building in the background. In the foreground, abstract representations of Solana\'s fast network (glowing lines, quick data flow) converge with a stylized Japanese financial district skyline, featuring a subtle \'Laser Digital\' logo integrated into one of the modern buildings. The overall tone should be professional, data-driven, and forward-looking, using a palette of blues, greens, and golds to signify growth and stability in the financial tech sector. Avoid literal people or specific crypto logos, focusing on conceptual financial representations.",
