      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "The most probable outcome is that Apple will face some form of financial penalty or settlement, alongside increased pressure to enhance its App Store security protocols and transparency regarding app vetting. While a catastrophic blow to Apple\'s brand is unlikely given its strong market position, the incident will certainly reinforce the need for continuous improvement in platform security and user education regarding crypto risks. The probability of a complete dismissal without any impact is low, given the clear financial losses by users and the alleged negligence.",
